      "application": "Microsoft Excel for Mac",
      "version": "16.114",
      "date": "2026-10-20",
      "method": "AppleScript, a fresh workbook closed without saving; no existing workbook content read or changed. A9=1/0, B1=NPV(0.1,A9:A9), B2=NPV(0.1,1/0), B3=NPV(0.1,110,121).",
      "results": [
        "#DIV/0!",
